{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華對以色列的愛"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「以色列年幼時，我就愛他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"視他為兒子，把他從埃及召出來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，我越召喚他們，他們就跑得越遠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"給巴力獻祭，向偶像燒香。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我教以法蓮學步，張開雙臂抱他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻不知道是我醫治他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我用慈繩愛索牽引他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"解開他們所負的重軛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"彎腰餵養他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"「他們要返回埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞述要統治他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們不肯歸向我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀劍之災要臨到他們的城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀壞他們的城門，將他們吞噬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們倚仗自己的計謀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民執意離我而去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們雖然求告至高的我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不會救拔他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮啊，我怎能捨棄你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，我怎能棄絕你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能使你的下場如押瑪？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能對待你如對待洗扁？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心意改變，我滿懷憐愛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不再發烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再毀滅以法蓮。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我是上帝，不是世人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是住在你們中間的聖者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不帶著烈怒來臨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"「以色列子民必跟隨耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂要像獅子一樣吼叫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂吼叫的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要戰戰兢兢地從西方來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必戰戰兢兢前來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像從埃及趕來的鳥兒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像從亞述飛來的鴿子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要帶他們返回家園。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["對以色列和猶大的指控"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"以法蓮用謊話包圍我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家用詭詐環繞我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大依然背離聖潔、信實的上帝","poem":1},{"noteId":20},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":20,"caller":"+","text":"「猶大依然背離聖潔、信實的上帝」或譯為「猶大卻與上帝同行，忠於聖者」。","reference":{"chapter":11,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}